(7658310, 1247463, 60581, '<td valign="top">+1  I was expecting this also to show you!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> this was one of my very favourites in the challenge along with the blue and the red .. i''m surprised this didnt get a ribbon .. if i''d had any say in the results it would have ... congratulations on a really beautiful image .. :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', '+1  I was expecting this also to show you! Originally posted by roz: this was one of my very favourites in the challenge along with the blue and the red .. i''m surprised this didnt get a ribbon .. if i''d had any say in the results it would have ... congratulations on a really beautiful image .. :) ', '2020-04-13 08:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
