(7658435, 1247322, 52549, '<td valign="top">Love the shadows and light in this beauty. I''m very surprised it didn''t place higher...</td>', 'Love the shadows and light in this beauty. I''m very surprised it didn''t place higher...', '2020-04-14 04:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7658437, 1247454, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, Mary Ann.</td>', 'This is a lovely image, Mary Ann.', '2020-04-14 04:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7658438, 1247437, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> Doesn''t surprise me in the slightest that this was yours. I do love your lighting!! You should hold a masterclass video on your techniques for all of us who are stranded at home. :)<br/> <br/>Huge congrats on the blue! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank, Wendy. Actually at first I had the two flashes with packets of teabags in front of them to dim the lighting and ended up with the flashes turned away and facing the wall. Not exactly masterclass material...;-)  but it was the only way I could get the lighting right.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: Doesn''t surprise me in the slightest that this was yours. I do love your lighting!! You should hold a masterclass video on your techniques for all of us who are stranded at home. :) Huge congrats on the blue!   Thank, Wendy. Actually at first I had the two flashes with packets of teabags in front of them to dim the lighting and ended up with the flashes turned away and facing the wall. Not exactly masterclass material...;-)  but it was the only way I could get the lighting right.', '2020-04-14 04:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
